":"00:08:12","end":"00:08:14","text":"所以我来给你讲"},{"number":196,"start":"00:08:14","end":"00:08:16","text":"异地会造成问题"},{"number":197,"start":"00:08:16","end":"00:08:18","text":"但是不是说所有的异地都指向"},{"number":198,"start":"00:08:18","end":"00:08:19","text":"那就太绝对化了"},{"number":199,"start":"00:08:19","end":"00:08:20","text":"就没有办法婚姻存续"},{"number":200,"start":"00:08:20","end":"00:08:22","text":"或者说是甚至是婚姻美好"},{"number":201,"start":"00:08:22","end":"00:08:24","text":"不是的啊"},{"number":202,"start":"00:08:26","end":"00:08:28","text":"嗯好的好的"},{"number":203,"start":"00:08:28","end":"00:08:30","text":"谢谢大兵哥"},{"number":204,"start":"00:08:30","end":"00:08:30","text":"谢谢我"},{"number":205,"start":"00:08:30","end":"00:08:32","text":"没有其他问题了"},{"number":206,"start":"00:08:32","end":"00:08:33","text":"好谢谢嗯"},{"number":207,"start":"00:08:33","end":"00:08:34","text":"好拜拜"}],"sameDate":[{"slug":"2026-07-16-call-01","title":"33岁脑瘫后遗症患者被全村叫白痴长大，深陷妄想恐惧无法正常生活","date":"2026-07-16","duration":"17分42秒","index":13,"callNumber":1,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-07-16-call-01"},{"slug":"2026-07-16-call-02","title":"山东女博士该不该为江苏男友放弃编制，咨询师：牺牲感比异地更危险","date":"2026-07-16","duration":"9分0秒","index":14,"callNumber":2,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-07-16-call-02"},{"slug":"2026-07-16-call-03","title":"30岁硕士尝试AI自媒体游戏剪辑又炒股，问咨询师如何靠副业赚500万","date":"2026-07-16","duration":"14分30秒","index":15,"callNumber":3,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-07-16-call-03"},{"slug":"2026-07-16-call-04","title":"49岁母亲因分房长辈离去愧疚，遭遇家暴却因婚约自缚","date":"2026-07-16","duration":"25分33秒","index":16,"callNumber":4,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-07-16-call-04"},{"slug":"2026-07-16-call-05","title":"博士事业编遇降薪，新岗珠三角高薪但是夜班还要跨专业如何选","date":"2026-07-16","duration":"18分53秒","index":17,"callNumber":5,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-07-16-call-05"},{"slug":"2026-07-16-call-06","title":"21岁医学生学费重想学自媒体挣生活费，咨询师帮她避坑并教方法","date":"2026-07-16","duration":"20分11秒","index":18,"callNumber":6,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-07-16-call-06"},{"slug":"2026-07-16-call-07","title":"25